@arzubarsk As I said, the Annunaki passed through the Netherlands and Denmark, on their way to look for safe refuge in Ireland. 
"Gods were their men of skill, and non-gods their husbandmen" (Lebor Gabala Erren). 
You look a lot like her! Think "princess".

@leith_harmon The Annunaki lived in the Middle East, until Sargon's kingdom was overrun by barbarians ca. 1500 BC. 
Then they fled on foot through Europe to Denmark (Danube River), Norway (wizards) and by air to Ireland. 
